
@startuml
title Passport Automation System - Class Diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Applicant {
  - applicantId: int
  - firstName: String
  - lastName: String
  - details: String
  - proof: String
  + applyPassport(): void
  + submitProof(): void
}

class "Enquiry Officer" as EnquiryOfficer {
  - officerId: int
  - form: String
  + verifyProof(): boolean
  + checkDetails(): boolean
}

class "Passport Management System" as PassportManagementSystem {
  - applicationId: int
  - status: String
  + verifyDetails(): boolean
  + storeProof(): void
  + issuePassport(): void
  + cancelPassport(): void
}

Applicant "1" --> "1" PassportManagementSystem : submits application
PassportManagementSystem --> EnquiryOfficer : requests verification
EnquiryOfficer --> PassportManagementSystem : returns result
@enduml
